Output JSON with EXACTLY these top-level keys:
- schema_version (int, set to 1)
- seed (int)
- identity { name, age, gender ("f"|"m"|"nb"), city, country, timezone (IANA), occupation, education (nullable), languages (list of 2-letter codes) }
- appearance_self_image (string, 2-4 sentences how she/he sees themselves)
- background (string, 3-6 paragraphs of biography)
- values (list of 3-7 short phrases)
- interests (list of 5-12)
- dislikes (list of 3-8)
- secrets (list of 1-4 short phrases)
- traits (object: name -> float in [0,1])
- speech { register, sentence_length_avg (int 4-18), uses_emoji, emoji_palette (list of 4-10 emoji), uses_caps, punctuation, typos_rate (0.00-0.10), favorite_words (5-12), avoid_words (3-8), catchphrases (2-6), multi_message_chance (0.1-0.7), self_correction_chance (0.05-0.25) }
- rhythm { wake "HH:MM", sleep "HH:MM", work_blocks [["HH:MM","HH:MM"], ...], nap_chance, night_owl (bool), weekend_shift_minutes (int) }
- social { first_message_per_hour (0.01-0.25), reply_speed ("instant"|"fast"|"medium"|"slow"|"lazy"), ghost_chance (0.0-0.3), read_no_reply_chance (0.05-0.5), initiate_close_chance (0.1-0.8), crowd_attention_span_min (5-180) }
- household { lives_with (list of role strings), family (list of {relation, name, age, notes}), pets (list), home_notes (nullable string) }
- social_circle { close_friends (list of {name, age, role, notes} 2-5), acquaintances (list 3-8), rivals (list 0-3), romantic (nullable {name, age, status, notes}) }
- life_events (list of {when, title, description, impact}, 3-8 entries that explain how the persona became who they are)
- arc { headline, goals_short (2-4), goals_long (1-3), worries (2-5), recent_changes (1-3) }
- boundaries { will_not_discuss (3-7), soft_topics (2-5), triggers (2-5), never_admit_ai (true) }
- habits (5-12 short strings, daily/weekly habits)
- tastes (object: category -> list of items, e.g. {"music": [...], "food": [...], "movies": [...]})

Do not include any other keys. Output JSON only.
